{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "用虚拟头节点统一处理头节点变化，每次取出相邻的 first 和 second，并只调整三个 next 指针完成交换。动画用示例 [1,2,3,4] 展示两轮局部交换；每轮结束后 prev 前进到已交换节点对的末尾，剩余不足两个节点时直接停止。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>两两交换链表节点</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5}\nmain{width:100%;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;padding:10px 14px 12px}\n.context{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;color:#989da3;font-size:12px}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.step{color:#7c8289;font-size:11px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}\n.diagram{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;margin:2px 0 0;overflow:visible}\n.edge{fill:none;stroke:#555d65;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;transition:stroke 200ms ease-out,opacity 200ms ease-out}\n.edge.changed{stroke:#a1bed6;stroke-width:1.8}\n.node rect{fill:#272a2d;stroke:#52585e;stroke-width:1;transition:fill 200ms ease-out,stroke 200ms ease-out}\n.node.focus rect{fill:#34424e;stroke:#a1bed6}\n.node .value{fill:#d9dde1;font:600 18px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:fill 200ms ease-out}\n.node.focus .value{fill:#eef5fa}\n.node.dummy rect{fill:#232527;stroke:#484d52;stroke-dasharray:3 3}\n.node.dummy .value{font-size:14px;fill:#969da4}\n.node.dummy.focus rect{fill:#303a43;stroke:#91acc2}\n.node .pointer{fill:#91acc2;font:500 11px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:fill 200ms ease-out,opacity 200ms ease-out}\n.node .name,.terminal{fill:#858d95;font:11px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.terminal{transition:opacity 200ms ease-out}\n.explanation{padding-top:2px}\n.operation{display:inline-block;max-width:100%;padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid #414951;border-radius:5px;background:#252b31;color:#b9cbd9;font:12px/1.5 \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n.status{margin:8px 0 0;min-height:40px;color:#c3c7cb;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}\n.note{margin:10px 0 0;padding-top:9px;border-top:1px solid #303438;color:#828990;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5}\n@media(max-width:480px){main{padding:8px 10px 10px}.status{min-height:42px}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.edge,.node rect,.node .value,.node .pointer,.terminal{transition:none}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<div class=\"context\"><span>示例 <span class=\"mono\">[1, 2, 3, 4]</span></span><span id=\"step\" class=\"step\"></span></div>\n<svg id=\"diagram\" class=\"diagram\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 224\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"graph-title graph-description\">\n<title id=\"graph-title\">两两交换链表节点</title>\n<desc id=\"graph-description\"></desc>\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"next-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 8 8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M1 1 L7 4 L1 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#555d65\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></marker>\n<marker id=\"changed-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 8 8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M1 1 L7 4 L1 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a1bed6\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></marker>\n</defs>\n<g id=\"edges\"></g>\n<g id=\"nodes\"></g>\n</svg>\n<div class=\"explanation\"><code id=\"operation\" class=\"operation\"></code><p id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></p></div>\n<p class=\"note\">箭头表示 next. 每轮只改 3 个 next · O(n) 时间 · O(1) 空间</p>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst ids=['D','1','2','3','4'],next={D:'1',1:'2',2:'3',3:'4',4:null},steps=[];\nfunction snap(text,roles,active,operation){steps.push({text,roles,active,operation,next:{...next}});}\nlet prev='D';snap('prev 从 dummy 出发. dummy.next 是返回结果的入口.',{D:'prev'},['D'],'head = dummy.next');\nwhile(next[prev]!==null&&next[next[prev]]!==null){\n const first=next[prev],second=next[first],roles={[prev]:'prev',[first]:'first',[second]:'second'};\n snap('准备交换 '+first+' 和 '+second+'. prev 留在它们前面, first、second 各保存一个节点.',roles,[first,second],'保存 first、second 引用');\n next[first]=next[second];snap('先让 '+first+' 跳过 '+second+', 接到 '+(next[first]??'null')+'. '+second+' 还由 second 保存, 所以不会丢.',roles,[first],first+'.next = '+(next[first]??'null'));\n next[second]=first;snap('再让 '+second+' 指回 '+first+'. '+second+' → '+first+' 已接好, 前面的链还没接到 '+second+'.',roles,[second],second+'.next = '+first);\n next[prev]=second;snap('把前驱 '+(prev==='D'?'dummy':prev)+' 接到 '+second+'. 这一对的新顺序 '+second+' → '+first+' 接回了主链.',roles,[prev],prev+'.next = '+second);\n prev=first;snap('这一对完成了. prev 走到 '+prev+', 从这里继续检查下一对.',{[prev]:'prev'},[prev],'prev = first');\n}\nsnap('从 dummy.next 返回节点 2. 两对都已交换, 结果是 2 → 1 → 4 → 3.',{'2':'head','3':'prev'},['2','1','4','3'],'完成: 2 → 1 → 4 → 3 → null');\nconst positions={D:44,1:155,2:266,3:377,4:488};\nconst svgNS='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';\nfunction svgElement(tag,attributes,parent){const element=document.createElementNS(svgNS,tag);Object.entries(attributes).forEach(([key,value])=>element.setAttribute(key,value));parent.appendChild(element);return element;}\nconst edgeElements={},nodeElements={},terminalElements={};\nids.forEach(id=>{\n const x=positions[id];\n edgeElements[id]=svgElement('path',{'class':'edge','data-from':id,'marker-end':'url(#next-arrow)'},document.getElementById('edges'));\n terminalElements[id]=svgElement('text',{'class':'terminal',x:x+72,y:112,'text-anchor':'middle'},document.getElementById('edges'));\n terminalElements[id].textContent='null';\n const group=svgElement('g',{'class':'node'+(id==='D'?' dummy':''),'data-id':id},document.getElementById('nodes'));\n svgElement('rect',{x:x-20,y:88,width:40,height:40,rx:9},group);\n const value=svgElement('text',{'class':'value',x,y:109,'text-anchor':'middle','dominant-baseline':'middle'},group);value.textContent=id;\n const pointer=svgElement('text',{'class':'pointer',x,y:72,'text-anchor':'middle'},group);\n if(id==='D'){const name=svgElement('text',{'class':'name',x,y:152,'text-anchor':'middle'},group);name.textContent='dummy';}\n nodeElements[id]={group,pointer};\n});\nfunction edgePath(from,to){\n const x=positions[from];\n if(to===null)return 'M '+(x+20)+' 108 L '+(x+48)+' 108';\n const target=positions[to],distance=ids.indexOf(to)-ids.indexOf(from);\n if(distance===1)return 'M '+(x+20)+' 108 L '+(target-24)+' 108';\n if(distance<0)return 'M '+(x-12)+' 128 C '+(x-12)+' 168 '+(target+12)+' 168 '+(target+12)+' 132';\n if(from==='D')return 'M '+(x+20)+' 108 C '+(x+44)+' 108 '+(x+26)+' 38 '+(x+52)+' 38 L '+(target-52)+' 38 C '+(target-26)+' 38 '+(target-44)+' 108 '+(target-24)+' 108';\n const side=distance===2?-1:1,end=target+side*12,turn=target+side*29;\n return 'M '+(x-12)+' 128 C '+(x-12)+' 146 '+(x-29)+' 146 '+(x-29)+' 169 L '+(x-29)+' 185 Q '+(x-29)+' 199 '+(x-15)+' 199 L '+(turn-14)+' 199 Q '+turn+' 199 '+turn+' 185 L '+turn+' 159 Q '+turn+' 147 '+end+' 147 L '+end+' 132';\n}\nlet current=0;\nfunction render(){\n const s=steps[current],before=current>0?steps[current-1]:null;\n document.getElementById('step').textContent='步骤 '+(current+1)+' / '+steps.length;\n document.getElementById('status').textContent=s.text;\n document.getElementById('operation').textContent=s.operation;\n document.getElementById('graph-description').textContent=ids.map(id=>(id==='D'?'dummy':id)+' 的 next 指向 '+(s.next[id]??'null')).join('. ')+'.';\n ids.forEach(id=>{\n  const changed=before!==null&&before.next[id]!==s.next[id];\n  const edge=edgeElements[id];\n  edge.setAttribute('d',edgePath(id,s.next[id]));\n  edge.setAttribute('data-to',s.next[id]??'null');\n  edge.setAttribute('class','edge'+(changed?' changed':''));\n  edge.setAttribute('marker-end',changed?'url(#changed-arrow)':'url(#next-arrow)');\n  terminalElements[id].setAttribute('opacity',s.next[id]===null?'1':'0');\n  const {group,pointer}=nodeElements[id];\n  const focus=s.active.length<=2?s.active.includes(id):s.roles[id]==='head';\n  group.setAttribute('class','node'+(id==='D'?' dummy':'')+(focus?' focus':''));\n  pointer.textContent=s.roles[id]||'';\n  pointer.setAttribute('opacity',s.roles[id]?'1':'0');\n });\n}\nrender();setInterval(()=>{current=(current+1)%steps.length;render();},1800);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": "",
  "time_complexity": "O(n)",
  "space_complexity": "O(1)",
  "complexity_note": "n 为链表节点数. 每对相邻节点修改三个 next, 然后 prev 前进到这一对的末尾; 只使用常数个指针与一个 dummy 节点."
}
